{"availability":"available","full":"Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm","name":"client-portal-crm","description":"Modern SaaS client portal and CRM built with Next.js, TypeScript, Prisma and Supabase.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":7,"created":"2026-07-29T06:13:57Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:04:29Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://client-portal-crm.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://client-portal-crm.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.203Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.203Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.203Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.203Z","stars":1,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-tenant CRM SaaS for freelancers and small agencies — every account is an Organization with its own team (staff members with roles), its own Clients/Projects/Tasks/Invoices, its own billing subscription, and an optional Client Portal its clients can log into directly. Built with Next.js App Router, Prisma, and Supabase.","A complete, tested multi-tenant SaaS foundation: real multi-tenancy, real Paddle billing (buyer supplies their own account/credentials — see Billing), a Client Portal, attachments, comments, notifications, onboarding, analytics, search, and a Platform Admin console — all built on Server Components and Server Actions with no client-side data-fetching library."],"features":["Multi-tenant Organizations — every account belongs to an Organization; staff join it via a Membership with a role (OWNER / ADMIN / MEMBER), enforced server-side on every sensitive mutation (team management, billing,…","Clients, Projects, Tasks, Invoices — full CRUD for each, scoped to the active organization at the database query level.","Client Portal (/portal) — a separate, thinner identity space (PortalUser, invited per-Client) where a client can log in to view their own projects and invoices — no access to staff data, no access to other clients.","Team & invitations — invite staff by email (token-based, expiring, single-use), manage roles, invite clients to the portal the same way.","Attachments — real file uploads (Supabase Storage) on clients/projects/tasks, with a server-validated type/size allowlist."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8855a528b5e4502a82b656ce2466d295abb48f54d66300bc7cf3661266571f3d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.351Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.351Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A multi-tenant CRM SaaS for freelancers and small agencies — every account is an Organization with its own team (staff members with roles), its own Clients/Projects/Tasks/Invoices, its own billing subscription, and an optional Client Portal its clients can log into directly. Built with Next.js App Router, Prisma, and Supabase.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"A multi-tenant CRM SaaS for freelancers and small agencies — every account is an Organization with its own team (staff members with roles), its own Clients/Projects/Tasks/Invoices, its own billing subscription, and an optional Client Portal its clients can log into directly.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A second staff account (demo2@clientportal.dev, same password) is a plain Member of the same organization — sign in as either to see the same shared workspace, with the Team page showing both.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"All three accounts are seeded via npm run db:seed (prisma/seed.ts, see Database setup) into one already-connected demo organization — clients, projects, tasks, invoices, a couple of threaded comments (including an @-mention), and a couple of notifications, so every staff account lands directly on a populated dashboard, no extra setup step required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"This repository contains no Paddle account, no real API keys/secrets/price IDs, no KYC/KYB, and no payout/banking information — the current maintainer of this codebase has not created a Paddle account or entered any billing credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"This repository contains no Paddle account, no real API keys/secrets/price IDs, no KYC/KYB, and no payout/banking information — the current maintainer of this codebase has not created a Paddle account or entered any billing credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8855a528b5e4502a82b656ce2466d295abb48f54d66300bc7cf3661266571f3d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.352Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:04:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sereja-dev/client-portal-crm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:49.353Z","hash":"8855a528b5e4502a82b656ce2466d295abb48f54d66300bc7cf3661266571f3d","originalBytes":33883,"storedBytes":33883,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["billing","real","client","prisma","supabase","run","own","docs","see","platform","paddle","portal","never","database","every","npm","email","admin","project","app","storage","organization","data","only","staff","url","account","clients","demo","auth","projects","webhook","deployment","images","invoices","key","analytics","api","dashboard","cron","env","platform-admin","separate","actions","attachments","build","file","identity","one","pr